sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant N as Neutron (floating IP)
  participant K as keepalived (MASTER)
  participant T as Traefik
  participant S as Sandbox VM
  participant A as ipo-agent
  C->>N: GET / (Host alpha.cstam.felcloud.tn), port 80
  N->>K: DNAT to VIP 10.0.0.100 (the MASTER holds it)
  K->>T: packet delivered to the local Traefik
  Note over T: router Host(alpha...) matches<br/>optional middlewares (none by default):<br/>secure-headers, rate-limit, compress
  T->>S: GET / to http://10.20.0.x:80
  S-->>T: 200 response
  T-->>C: 200 response
  T-)A: JSON access log line (host, status, duration)
  Note over A: counts per host for 10 s, never stores<br/>client addresses or query strings
  A-)A: POST /v1/gateways/gw-a/traffic
